es, effective parameters, templates and inheritance. Read the short private index in full; source metadata lines 1-120; effective_records occupy snapshot/canonical lines 820366-843524. Use targeted rg/source anchors and bounded ranges, not a dump of all 843540 lines. Private search identifiers may be used only in protected tool activity, never public findings. Verify material Deny/DINE/Modify/Append and Audit assertions, complete dependency paths, residency/cost coverage and residual runner-backup gap against original source. Unknown central security/logging usage and allocations are unknown, never free. Audit is not inherently Deny. Later technical bindings are not deployment proof and do not require new business questions merely to populate policy fields. No shell, code execution, writes (including scratch), delegation, user questions, web/Azure/pricing/network access or guessed paths. Avoid out-of-range reads; short files without ranges. Review the supplied/linked applicable checklists and primary independently. No predetermined verdict.\n## Privacy\nReturned public findings must use only opaque policy refs/source locators and generic descriptions: no actual tenant/subscription/management-group GUIDs, resource/principal IDs, customer policy names/parameter values, contacts/domains or absolute private read paths. Never alter facts or severity to manufacture privacy/verdict.\n## Outputs\nReturn exactly one raw JSON object beginning with { and ending with }, using the substantive one-shot schema. Copy cache_inputs and supporting_inputs unchanged. Use traces_to arrays and nonempty string evidence. Omit IDs/counts/review_execution; recorder derives them. Give an independent honest APPROVED/NEEDS_REVISION/BLOCKED verdict. No introduction, Markdown fences, shell serialization or success summary."
